{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HOS","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"何西阿書","commonName":"何西阿書","title":"何西阿書","order":28,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"c837f467a020938eec4ea2e106f9662e4fc510f07ebe6c3afbf22ab35e3647fb","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HOS/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HOS/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":196},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶和華譴責以色列"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"以色列人哪，你們當聽耶和華的話。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華與這地的居民爭辯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因這地上無誠實，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無良善，無人認識上帝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但起假誓，不踐前言，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"殺害，偷盜，姦淫，行強暴，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"殺人流血，接連不斷。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，這地悲哀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其上的民、田野的獸、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"空中的鳥必都衰微，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"海中的魚也必消滅。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["譴責祭司"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"然而，人都不必爭辯，也不必指責，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為這民與抗拒祭司的人一樣。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你這祭司必日間跌倒；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"先知也必夜間與你一同跌倒；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必滅絕你的母親。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的民因無知識而滅亡。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你棄掉知識，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也必棄掉你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你不再給我作祭司。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你既忘了你上帝的律法，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也必忘記你的兒女。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"祭司越發增多，就越發得罪我；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必使他們的榮耀變為羞辱。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們吃我民的贖罪祭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"滿心願意我民犯罪。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"將來民如何，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祭司也必如何；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必因他們所行的懲罰他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"照他們所做的報應他們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們吃，卻不得飽；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"行淫，而不得立後；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們離棄耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不遵他的命。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["譴責拜偶像的罪"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"姦淫和酒，並新酒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"奪去人的心。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的民求問木偶，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以為木杖能指示他們；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們的淫心使他們失迷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們就行淫離棄上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不守約束，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在各山頂，各高岡的橡樹、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"楊樹、栗樹之下，獻祭燒香，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為樹影美好。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，你們的女兒淫亂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的新婦","poem":1},{"noteId":11},{"text":"行淫。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的女兒淫亂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的新婦行淫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我卻不懲罰她們；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你們自己離群與娼妓同居，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"與妓女一同獻祭。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這無知的民必致傾倒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"以色列啊，你雖然行淫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"猶大卻不可犯罪。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要往吉甲去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要上到伯‧亞文，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不要指着永生的耶和華起誓。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列倔強，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"猶如倔強的母牛；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"現在耶和華要放他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如同放羊羔在寬闊之地。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"以法蓮親近偶像，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"任憑他吧！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們所喝的已經發酸，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們時常行淫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的官長最愛羞恥的事。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"風把他們裹在翅膀裏；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們因所獻的祭必致蒙羞。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":11,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：兒婦；下同","reference":{"chapter":4,"verse":13}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HOS/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HOS/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HOS/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":19}